### Auth API test requests
# Doplň požiadavky po dohode na endpointoch a API kontrakte.

### Auth API test requests

### AUTH-01: Úspešná registrácia
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "displayName": "Test User",
  "password": "Test12345"
}


### AUTH-02: Duplicitný email
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "displayName": "Another User",
  "password": "Test12345"
}


### AUTH-03: Úspešné prihlásenie
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Test12345"
}


### AUTH-04: Prihlásenie so zlým heslom
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "WrongPassword123"
}


### AUTH-05: Registrácia s neplatným emailom
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "abc",
  "displayName": "Test User",
  "password": "Test12345"
}


### AUTH-06: Registrácia bez hesla
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "another@example.com",
  "displayName": "Test User"
}


### AUTH-07: Účet bez tímov po registrácii a prihlásení
# Použi nový testovací email a fake heslo, potom over, že GET /api/teams vráti [].
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Origin: http://localhost:5173
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "matrix-owner@example.test",
  "displayName": "Matrix Owner",
  "password": "MatrixPass-2026!",
  "stayLoggedIn": true
}


### AUTH-08: Prázdny GET /api/teams
GET http://localhost:3000/api/teams


### AUTH-09: Anonymný prístup k chráneným endpointom
GET http://localhost:3000/api/auth/me

###

GET http://localhost:3000/api/teams


### AUTH-10: Vytvorenie tímu a OWNER/MEMBER prístup
# Po vytvorení tímu dosaď jeho id do premenných teamId a ownerId.
POST http://localhost:3000/api/teams
Origin: http://localhost:5173
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Matrix Team",
  "description": "Temporary test team"
}

###

GET http://localhost:3000/api/teams/{{teamId}}

###

POST http://localhost:3000/api/teams/{{teamId}}/members
Origin: http://localhost:5173
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "matrix-member@example.test"
}

###

GET http://localhost:3000/api/teams/{{teamId}}

###

PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/teams/{{teamId}}/members/{{ownerId}}/role
Origin: http://localhost:5173
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "MEMBER"
}


### AUTH-11: Pokus o prístup k cudziemu tímu
GET http://localhost:3000/api/teams/{{foreignTeamId}}


### AUTH-12: Profilové meno
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/auth/profile
Origin: http://localhost:5173
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "displayName": "Matrix Owner Updated"
}

###

GET http://localhost:3000/api/auth/me


### AUTH-13: Refresh stránky a stayLoggedIn
GET http://localhost:3000/api/auth/me


### AUTH-14: Refresh cookie
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/refresh
Origin: http://localhost:5173


### AUTH-15: Zmazanie tímu
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/teams/{{teamId}}
Origin: http://localhost:5173

###

GET http://localhost:3000/api/teams/{{teamId}}


### AUTH-16: Logout
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/logout
Origin: http://localhost:5173

###

GET http://localhost:3000/api/auth/me